	// 4th pass: anti-causal filter along i, for each j (reverse i)
	//
	// Original C loops: i from W-1 down to 0.
	// As in the second pass, we iterate an explicit reverse index
	// state while letting the traverser run forward over i.
	// ------------------------------------------------------------------
